// There are three possible result outcomes which correspond to the following HTTP status codes and scenarios.
// INVALID  - 400 - error deserializing snapshot.
// INVALID  - 400 - invalid purl.
// ACCEPTED - 201 - snapshot is submitted for the non-default branch.
// ACCEPTED - 201 - snapshot is submitted for the default branch and there's already a snapshot with a newer commit SHA.
// SUCCESS  - 201 - snapshot is submitted for the default branch and it's the snapshot with the latest commit SHA.
